---
description: Beaubnana Astro and Shopify architecture
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---
This is an Astro static storefront retaining the Webflow visual design and Shopify Storefront / Buy Button integration. Keep the existing Shopify plan and avoid unnecessary backend services or frontend frameworks.

Use src/components for shared markup, src/layouts for the HTML shell, and src/pages for routes. Products and policies are generated with getStaticPaths; retain the existing .html URLs. Do not reintroduce generated source HTML or string-replacement build scripts.

Read README.md and docs/astro-migration.md for data-source and hosting configuration. Build-time data uses Storefront only; Admin tokens must never enter browser configuration. The default base is /beaubnana for GitHub Pages, with BASE_PATH=/ supported for a future domain-root host.

Run npm run check, npm run build, npm test and relevant browser checks after changes. Deploy only dist/. Publishing and the later Cloudflare move require explicit user instructions; a code edit does not authorize deployment.
